invariant: INV-17
file: src/chacha20.c
catches: chacha20_equiv_test
reason: block returns without wiping its rounds' words. The rounds are a
  permutation of the state, so the sixteen words give the key back. Every
  block it writes is still right. bin/chacha20_equiv_test copies the stack
  below a call of chacha20_block and looks for the sixteen words side by
  side.

--- old
    ct_wipe(x, sizeof x);
}
--- new
}
